# Chocobo on the Loose! (jeuno 92): the available check's operands. A level 19 Warrior (the others as main):
# Brutus: no section. A level 20 Warrior with ENABLE_TOAU 0 (a GM setting): no section; 1.25 (the Lua's `== 1` is
# false; a rounding read would make it 1): no section; ENABLE_TOAU 1: 10093, begun.
# Brutus's other quests are kept silent: Chocobo's Wounds and Save My Son completed (a GM, before login: Chocobo's
# Wounds' completed section wants Save My Son not completed), level 25 (Path of the Beastmaster wants 30); his script
# then starts nothing (Chocobo's Wounds completed, Wings of Gold / Scattered into Shadow not); a talk with
# no quest reply plays his default 66 (DefaultActions).
lists UpperJeuno/Brutus/onTrigger UpperJeuno/onEventFinish/10093
char zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 job=WAR lvl=19
char other zone=UpperJeuno pos=-55.5,8.2,97.5 job=WAR lvl=20
quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
other: quest Jeuno.ChocobosWounds completed
other: quest Jeuno.SaveMySon completed
login
trigger Brutus                          # level 19: no section; the default 66
finish
setting ENABLE_TOAU 0                   # a GM
other: login
other: trigger Brutus                   # level 20, ENABLE_TOAU 0: no section; the default 66
other: finish
setting ENABLE_TOAU 1.25                # a GM
other: trigger Brutus                   # ENABLE_TOAU 1.25 ~= 1: no section; the default 66
other: finish
setting ENABLE_TOAU 1                   # a GM
other: trigger Brutus                   # 10093
other: finish                           # begun
